	"heading": "cross-site request forgery (CSRF)",
	"headingTranslation": {
		"text": "クロスサイトリクエストフォージェリ (CSRF)",
		"sourceHash": "d4a82697cc19c6659f9f17172aa68fb10abca503b85374a71b0464bb3e90ca2d"
	},
	"definitions": [
		{
			"location": {
				"url": "https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-4/sp800-63b.html#def-and-acr"
			},
			"source": [
				{
					"type": "paragraph",
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": "An attack in which a "
						},
						{
							"type": "emphasis",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "subscriber"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": " who is currently "
						},
						{
							"type": "emphasis",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "authenticated"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": " to an "
						},
						{
							"type": "emphasis",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "RP"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": " and connected through a secure session browses an attacker’s website, causing the subscriber to unknowingly invoke unwanted actions at the RP. For example, if a bank website is vulnerable to a CSRF attack, it may be possible for a subscriber to unintentionally "
						},
						{
							"type": "emphasis",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "authorize"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": " a large money transfer by clicking on a malicious link in an email while a connection to the bank is open in another browser window."
						}
					]
				}
			],
			"translation": {
				"content": [
					{
						"type": "paragraph",
						"children": [
							{
								"type": "emphasis",
								"children": [
									{
										"type": "text",
										"value": "RP"
									}
								]
							},
							{
								"type": "text",
								"value": " に現在"
							},
							{
								"type": "emphasis",
								"children": [
									{
										"type": "text",
										"value": "認証"
									}
								]
							},
							{
								"type": "text",
								"value": "されており、安全なセッションで接続している "
							},
							{
								"type": "emphasis",
								"children": [
									{
										"type": "text",
										"value": "subscriber"
									}
								]
							},
							{
								"type": "text",
								"value": " が攻撃者のウェブサイトを閲覧し、それと知らずに RP で望まない操作を実行させられる攻撃。たとえば、銀行のウェブサイトが CSRF 攻撃に対して脆弱な場合、別のブラウザーのウィンドウで銀行との接続を開いたまま電子メール内の悪意あるリンクをクリックすることで、subscriber が意図せず多額の送金を"
							},
							{
								"type": "emphasis",
								"children": [
									{
										"type": "text",
										"value": "認可"
									}
								]
							},
							{
								"type": "text",
								"value": "してしまう可能性がある。"
							}
						]
					}
				],
				"sourceHash": "ccb45b51bdd619babf10e520e5b065378fa20669f874f80de15269907e4d8fb8"
			}
		}
	],
